{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0293_1000_p", "source_sha256": "46a8b13950f1b9fb2a69b3544764b99b621272a6531553fb9cd3b680f7679432", "ja": "（グラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』のパジャマ特集の\n撮影だ！　さて、杏奈の様子は……）", "zh": "（要开始写真杂志《偶像写真！！》的睡衣特辑拍摄了！那么，杏奈现在怎么样了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0293_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "09ec961021247afe2652e0a1f9ffb2886f6583e66b8ee4ae8a0dc7e24f26c6e9", "ja": "{$P$}さん……お待たせ、です……。\n着替え、終わったよ……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……让你久等了……  \n换好衣服了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0293_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4f5591e72653b3defa52a92d16c81188b3d4e9c6e8a36d43cd75a9c4476ed5d9", "ja": "おお、よく似合ってるよ。\nやっぱり杏奈にピッタリだったな。", "zh": "哇，很适合你哦。\n果然和杏奈很配啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0293_1003_024ann", "source_sha256": "545edae1e5f45b49f9886d8c3f0d79fb0d3906a03833898b3faf09683f590055", "ja": "本当……？　えへへ……♪\nそう言ってもらえて、うれしい、です……。", "zh": "真的……？嘿嘿……♪\n能听到你这么说，我很开心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0293_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "d037151e03de2ef8b6df987d7a39eaef79ba140f160e2449647ec80fd6246dab", "ja": "杏奈……お家でも、似てるパジャマ、\n着てるから……。なんか、落ち着きます……。", "zh": "杏奈……在家里也穿着相似的睡衣……所以，感觉很安心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0293_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e5fb5e1497ceca22a784d5c6a4cd42ca546e8e9365665259fa4630d54b9b5ed2", "ja": "それはよかった。\nその調子なら、撮影も上手くいきそうだな。", "zh": "那就好。照这个状态来看，拍摄应该也能顺利进行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0293_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "3d64a315dceb8a6946aef1a743aea95ff431d4e2fd45869724b55bce6ae6ed9e", "ja": "あ……。撮影は……ちょっと、心配……。\n杏奈……上手にできるかな……？", "zh": "啊……拍摄……有点担心……\n杏奈……能顺利完成吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0293_1007_p", "source_sha256": "112723e508dbb90d7d384c2f94900133b0de417df6d84a3091ad487c22295c14", "ja": "えっ？　何か問題でもあったか？", "zh": "咦？是出什么问题了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0293_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "adc85b71f7209425f48acfa0a2ade3cf71d9d6696e051c78033fe4f37d7732ec", "ja": "えと……なんだか、お家にいるみたいだな、って思って\n……杏奈、ずっとのんびりしちゃいそう……。", "zh": "那个……总觉得，好像在家里一样……\n杏奈可能会一直悠闲下去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0293_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "7478c415d5e4c22de47990ab99b25feac871e9252a24c68084166b7889e06c19", "ja": "あっ……お仕事だから、ちゃんと頑張るよ……。\nのんびりも、気をつけるけど……自信、ないかも……。", "zh": "啊……因为是工作，我会好好努力的……。\n虽然也会注意别太悠闲……但可能没什么自信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0293_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1458c339810357728274398960814f538e182299eb36114f0c5dff0b2b5da9a2", "ja": "なるほど。\nそういうことなら、心配しなくて大丈夫！", "zh": "原来如此。\n既然是这样，那就不用担心了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0293_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "eefd007279944016a9730a0b2236c2c4bd147af84e4366a14a15a123bf2d4ba2", "ja": "どういう、こと……？", "zh": "是怎么回事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0293_1012_p", "source_sha256": "08dab9fd2c8d37c0c28086ba0afa7f8de4f1365b97039eb6daa2160a1f5fb28d", "ja": "今日は、杏奈のリラックスした姿を撮るつもりなんだ。\nここを家だと思って、のんびり過ごしていいよ。", "zh": "今天打算拍下杏奈放松的样子。\n你就把这里当成家，放松地待着吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0293_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "e757f1a296b4f84a369380c661ee9d8fc6d58277fbe8f666982d14e6efa10f90", "ja": "そっか……。じゃあ、ちょっと安心……。\n杏奈……いつも通りにしてみる、ね……。", "zh": "这样啊……那我就稍微放心了……  \n杏奈……会试着像平时一样……做的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0293_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "7acebb9286daddb0014abfdfc059a819ad570326528530753ccf7ee6b7a36431", "ja": "んと……あったかいココア、あるかな……？\nあと、お布団の中で……ゲームして……。", "zh": "嗯……有没有……热可可呢……？\n还有，在被窝里……玩游戏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0293_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "525c868a6d839b2a55cfc18ccede372ed1ed75a40e182427d753be1a51330bec", "ja": "それとね……{$P$}さんと、\n一緒に……お話もしたい、な……。ダメ、かな……？", "zh": "还有啊……我也想和{$P$}先生一起……聊聊天……可以吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0293_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0293_1016_p", "source_sha256": "62f95df3abdcaf668bdcf65519c1008babe75662f1e8cfff75e207fb8c1b7ad5", "ja": "（杏奈が自然体で取り組んだ撮影は、順調に進んだ。\nうん、杏奈の魅力がしっかり伝わる写真になったぞ！）", "zh": "（杏奈以自然的状态投入拍摄，进展得很顺利。嗯，这些照片充分展现出了杏奈的魅力！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
